      "message": "According to 8.3.3.3.11 PE_SNK_Get_Source_Cap State\n\nThe SRC is supposed to go back to the SRC_READY state after sending the source caps if it started in SRC_READY.\n\nThe code as is was seems more correct.\n\n\nSee also Figure 8-67 Sink Port State Diagram",
