      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t think about the  if ((res \u003e\u003d 0) in this section, which means that the good CRC was received. So yes in this \"if\" clause, it should transition to PD_STATE_SRC_NEGOCIATE. I guess what\u0027s missing here  is handling the case where res \u003c 0, which is handled in PD_STATE_SRC_DISCOVERY by repeatedly sending SRC_CAP messages until the max number of tries.",
